title: "Diabetes risk in NHANES: Elastic Net vs XGBoost, explained with SHAP, women vs men"
abstract: "A reproducible R project that predicts diagnosed diabetes in US adults from NHANES, compares Elastic Net with XGBoost, explains both with SHAP and compares their behaviour in women and men."
